   - **Drift:** Conflicts with authority spec `02-spec/23-app-db/01-index.md` which specifies snake_case plural SQLite tables (`accounts`, `user_tokens`, `request_logs`) across 3 partitioned databases (`proxy_logs.db`, `security.db`, `user_tokens.db`).
